sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Mail as Mail (native app)
    participant SecurePII as SecurePII clipboard-monitor.ts
    participant Records as records-store.ts
    participant Chat as ChatGPT (browser)

    User->>Mail: Copy "SSN 123-45-6789"
    Mail-->>SecurePII: Clipboard change (polled every 500ms)
    SecurePII->>SecurePII: attribution.ts identifies the frontmost app

    alt App is on the exclusion list
        SecurePII-->>Mail: Leave the clipboard unchanged
    else App is not excluded
        SecurePII->>SecurePII: clipboard-decision.ts chooses redact
        SecurePII->>Records: Store the original, assign id 8a1f2c04
        SecurePII-->>Mail: Rewrite the clipboard to "[ssn:8a1f2c04]"
    end

    User->>Chat: Paste "[ssn:8a1f2c04]" with the placeholder instruction
    Chat-->>User: Reply echoes "[ssn:8a1f2c04]" as-is
    User->>SecurePII: Copy the reply from Chat
    SecurePII->>Records: Look up 8a1f2c04
    Records-->>SecurePII: Original value "123-45-6789"
    SecurePII-->>User: Restores the clipboard to the original SSN
